### 식사 리마인더 푸시 알림
POST {{url}}/api/v1/internal/batch/meals/reminders?hour=19
X-Internal-Batch-Key: {{secret-batch-key}}

### 리텐션 푸시 알림
POST {{url}}/api/v1/internal/batch/retentions/daily-check
X-Internal-Batch-Key: {{secret-batch-key}}

### 오늘의 할인 생성 (date를 빼면 내일)
POST {{url}}/api/v1/internal/batch/shop/daily-promotions?date=2026-11-05
X-Internal-Batch-Key: {{secret-batch-key}}

### 상품 판매량 갱신
POST {{url}}/api/v1/internal/batch/shop/sales-counts
X-Internal-Batch-Key: {{secret-batch-key}}